sequenceDiagram
    participant Q as Quartz Scheduler
    participant B as Peach Quartz Bridge
    participant E as PeachJobExecutor
    participant T as ThreadPoolManager(SCHEDULED)
    participant H as JobHandler
    participant S as JobExecutionStore

    Q->>B: trigger(jobCode, parameters)
    B->>E: execute(jobCode, providerId=quartz)
    E->>S: started(record)
    E->>T: submit(handler)
    T->>H: execute(JobContext)
    H-->>T: JobResult / Exception
    T-->>E: Future result
    E->>S: finished(record)
    E-->>B: JobResult / JobExecutionException
    B-->>Q: success / failure
